      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Māui se escondió y se quedó mirando.",
          "en": "Māui hid and watched."
        },
        {
          "es": "La madre ʻalae atizaba el fuego, y los demás traían comida, como hace una familia.",
          "en": "The mother ʻalae stirred the fire, and the others brought food, the way a family does."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero cada vez que Māui se acercaba, las aves lo veían. Desparramaban las brasas y huían.",
          "en": "But every time Māui crept closer, the birds saw him. They scattered the coals and ran away."
        },
        {
          "es": "El fuego se apagaba, y Māui solo encontraba cenizas frías.",
          "en": "The fire went out, and Māui found nothing but cold ashes."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces pensó un plan. La próxima vez no caminaría. Correría.",
          "en": "So he made a plan. Next time, he would not walk. He would run."
        }
      ],
