      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Al día siguiente, Māui se acercó por detrás, callado como una sombra.",
          "en": "The next day, Māui crept up from behind, as quiet as a shadow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Esta vez fue más rápido. Saltó y agarró a la madre ʻalae.",
          "en": "This time, he was too fast. He jumped out and grabbed the mother ʻalae."
        },
        {
          "es": "«Dime el secreto del fuego», dijo, «o nunca te soltaré.»",
          "en": "\"Tell me the secret of fire,\" he said, \"or I will never let you go.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "La madre ʻalae tenía miedo. «Suéltame», dijo. «Te lo diré.»",
          "en": "The mother bird was afraid. \"Let me go,\" she said. \"I will tell you.\""
        },
        {
          "es": "«Frota unos palos entre sí», dijo, y le nombró una madera para probar.",
          "en": "\"Rub sticks together,\" she said, and she named a wood for him to try."
        }
      ],
